    "text": "TELEVISION'Outlander' returns for its final season. When, where to stream Season 8Marina Johnson Saman ShafiqLouisville Courier JournalMarch 6, 2026, 11:06 a.m. ETSeason 8 of “Outlander” is here, and fans can expect an “epic conclusion” to the series.The final season of Starz’s cult-favorite time-traveling drama follows Claire (Caitríona Balfe) and Jamie Fraser (Sam Heughan) on a “heart-wrenching journey” as they return to Fraser’s Ridge after leaving the Revolutionary War. There, they are “met by new arrivals and changes to their community made during their years away.”Already a subscriber? Sign inTwo ways to continue readingPay Annually$149SAVE 50% versus MonthlySubscribeSubscribers getBEST DEALFull access to courier-journal.com including articles, videos, and moreA subscription to shareAccess to the eNewspaperShow featuresMonthly$1for the first monthSubscribeSubscribers getFull access to courier-journal.com including articles, videos, and moreA subscription to shareAccess to the eNewspaperShow featuresInterested in other subscriptions? Learn moreIf you purchase through our links, the USA Today Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
